{
 "_notes": [
  "Daemons of Chaos 3.0 (Mathias Eliasson). Every Daemon has Daemonic: Magical Ward (5+), Unbreakable, Fear -> ward:5, hold:'daemonic'.",
  "Khorne = Mighty Blow (1): +1 S in the FIRST round only (incl. Impact Hits and Stomps). Two builds where it matters.",
  "Nurgle = Poisoned Attacks (+1 To Wound) and -1 WS to enemies in base contact (the WS debuff is NOT modelled).",
  "Slaanesh = Armour Piercing (1) -> ap:1, plus one extra Attack per unsaved Wound -> bonus_attack_on_wound.",
  "Cavalry/Monstrous Cavalry use the HIGHEST T and W of rider or mount (rulebook p.72).",
  "Chariot troop-type armour save stacks with Natural Armour (rulebook: 'Natural Armour can be combined with other armour as normal').",
  "Monsters Stomp (D6)=3.5; Monstrous Creatures Stomp (D3)=2 via stomp_hits.",
  "Character builds are BARE (no magic items) unless the item is printed on the profile.",
  "Scope: CHARACTERS ONLY (generic lords/heroes + special characters). Bare profiles - no magic items or Daemonic Gifts unless printed on the profile."
 ],
